  "question": {
    "text": "The kinetic energy <math><mi>K</mi></math> of a particle moving along a circle of radius <math><mi>R</mi></math> depends on the distance covered s, as <math><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> where, a is constant. Then the force acting on the particle is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></math>",
